{"headword":"עָב³","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19\" href=\"/Isaiah.19\">Is 19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1\" href=\"/Isaiah.1\">1</a> and (<a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:44\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.44\">1 K 18:44</a> Kö<sup>Synt. 163</sup>) <strong>f. dark cloud, cloud-mass, thicket</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:44\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.44\">1 K 18:44</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.4\">Is 18:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.15\">Pr 16:15</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:4\" href=\"/Judges.5.4\">Ju 5:4</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.4\">2 S 23:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:18\" href=\"/Psalms.77.18\">ψ 77:18</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָבֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.12\">2 S 22:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:12\" href=\"/Psalms.18.12\">ψ 18:12</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָבָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:13\" href=\"/Psalms.18.13\">ψ 18:13</a> (but prob. del., v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָבַר²\" href=\"/BDB,_עָבַר²\", dir=\"rtl\">עבר</a> <strong>Qal</strong> ad fin.);—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>dark cloud:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"rain-cloud <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:4\" href=\"/Judges.5.4\">Ju 5:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.6\">Is 5:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:44\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.44\">1 K 18:44</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:45\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.45\">45</a> + 9 times."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"as high <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.14\">Is 14:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:6\" href=\"/Job.20.6\">Jb 20:6</a>, + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.11\">Ez 19:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.3\">31:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">14</a> (reading <span dir=\"rtl\">עָבוֹת</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֲבֹת\" href=\"/BDB,_עֲבֹת\", dir=\"rtl\">עֲבֹת</a>)."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"chariot of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.1\">Is 19:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:3\" href=\"/Psalms.104.3\">ψ 104:3</a>; covering his eyes <a data-ref=\"Job 22:14\" href=\"/Job.22.14\">Jb 22:14</a>."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"casting shadow <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.5\">Is 25:5</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.4\">2 S 23:4</a>."}],"num":"d."},{"senses":[{"definition":"as swift <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.8\">Is 60:8</a>, and transient <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.22\">44:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:15\" href=\"/Job.30.15\">Jb 30:15</a> (all sim.). <strong>f.</strong> disposed by God <a data-ref=\"Job 36:29\" href=\"/Job.36.29\">Jb 36:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 37:16\" href=\"/Job.37.16\">37:16</a>. <strong>g.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ טַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.4\">Is 18:4</a> <em>cloud of dew, dew-mist</em> (sim.)."}],"num":"e."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"(cloud-) <em>mass</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ שְׁחָקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.12\">2 S 22:12</a> <em>masses of clouds</em> (enwrapping <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>) = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:12\" href=\"/Psalms.18.12\">ψ 18:12</a> (v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:13\" href=\"/Psalms.18.13\">13</a> v. supr.)."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>thicket</em> as refuge <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.29\">Je 4:29</a> (perhaps under Aramaic influence).—<span dir=\"rtl\">עַב</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:9\" href=\"/Exodus.19.9\">Ex 19:9</a> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, עֲבִי\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_עֲבִי\">עֲבִי</a> sub <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, עָבָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_עָבָה\">עבה</a>. 1. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָב</span> v. p. 712 supr."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB07043","strong_numbers":["5645","5646"],"next_hw":"עוּב","prev_hw":"עוב","ordinal":"II.","occurrences":"33","quotes":[],"GK":["6264","6265","6266"],"TWOT":["1552a","1574a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}